    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061121.0169\n\nTOKYO, Nov. 21 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nIndian premier to visit Japan\n\n\n\n\nIndian Prime Minister Manmohan Singh will visit Japan from Dec. 13 and hold talks with Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe, Kyodo News reported Tuesday.\n\nSingh and Abe are to talk about a bilateral free trade agreement and are expected to discuss a strategic dialogue framework to strengthen ties on security, energy and economic issues, Japanese Foreign Ministry spokesman said on a press conference.\n\nSingh is also scheduled to meet with Emperor Akihito and Empress Michiko.",
